# The deploy is the app: index.html, src/, and the assets around them. Everything
# below is tooling that has no business being served from the app's domain — the
# repo is public, so nothing secret leaks either way, but migrations and database
# scripts answering on gsteam-v2.vercel.app is just untidy.
#
# scripts/ itself has to stay: vercel.json's build command is scripts/build-config.js,
# and .vercelignore decides what is uploaded, not just what is served. Only the
# database tooling inside it is excluded.
mcp/
scripts/*.py
scripts/check-reporting.js
supabase/
docs/
*.md
